        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/08/12/apple-hires-american-airlines-exec-to-lead-government-affairs/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2023/12/Apple-Park.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Apple has hired a new vice president of government affairs. <a href=\"https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-08-12/apple-taps-american-airlines-veteran-as-government-affairs-head?utm_medium=email&amp;utm_source=author_alert&amp;utm_term=260812&amp;utm_campaign=author_19842959\"><em>Bloomberg</em></a> today reports that Nate Gatten, a veteran executive from American Airlines, will take over the role on August 31.</p>",
