        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/08/11/grok-bot-is-an-all-new-iphone-and-mac-app-from-spacexai-and-cursor/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/08/grokbot.webp?w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">SpaceXAI and Cursor are in the process of becoming <a href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/06/16/spacex-lands-deal-to-likely-purchase-claude-code-and-openai-codex-competitor/\">a single company</a>, but first, the two firms are releasing an all-new iPhone and Mac app called Grok Bot.</p>",
