        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/08/apple-arcade-september-2026.png?w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">After a <a href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/08/06/apple-arcade-adding-the-ultimate-nfl-game-just-in-time-for-football-season/\">major Madden NFL 27 release</a> in August, <a href=\"https://apple.co/35ZjKQy\">Apple Arcade</a> is adding “two beloved puzzlers” to the ad-free platform in September.</p>",
