        "content_text": "<a href=\"https://lipn.univ-paris13.fr/~fernique/gallery.html#soccer\">The most iconic soccer ball</a> <em>is probably the telstar. It is made of 12 pentagons and 20 hexagons, with no two adjacent pentagons (this can be taken as a definition). What if we allow adjacent pentagons? Then we can get different balls...</em> <a href=\"https://lipn.univ-paris13.fr/~fernique/gallery/animball.html\">a script to visualize every possible ball</a>.",
