        "title": "R.I.P William Orbit",
        "url": "https://www.metafilter.com/214139/RIP-William-Orbit",
        "content_text": "William for All Saints, Prince, Madonna, Beth Orton, Blur  and many others has died at 69.  <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/music/2026/aug/07/william-orbit-pop-producer-madonna-all-saints-dies-aged-69\">Obituary</a> - and also a <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/music/2026/aug/07/william-orbit-greatest-recordings-prince-madonna-blur-beth-orton\">recommended playlist of his work over the years</a>.  Full discography on <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/William_Orbit\">his Wikipedia page</a>.",
