        "content_text": "<p>The International Astronomical Union has established a committee to finalize a list of official star names. Some companies offer unofficial naming rights for purchase. But the voices of certain communities are often left behind.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://psmag.com/social-justice/the-fault-in-our-star-names/\">The Fault in Our Star Names</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://psmag.com\">Pacific Standard</a>.</p>",
