        "title": "Report: Apple seeks publisher deals to give Siri AI better access to current events",
        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/08/12/report-apple-seeks-publisher-deals-to-give-siri-ai-better-access-to-current-events/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/06/siri-ai-ipados-27-design.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"https://www.wsj.com/business/media/apple-in-talks-to-pay-publishers-to-improve-ai-powered-siri-0641f64b\"><em>The Wall Street Journal</em> reports</a> that Apple has been pursuing content deals worth up to nine figures to improve Siri AI’s access to current news and information. Here are the details.</p>",
