        "title": "Apple releases iOS 26.6.1 beta for iPhone, plus more",
        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/08/10/apple-releases-ios-26-6-1-beta-for-iphone/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/07/ios-26-6-lg-iphone.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Today Apple <a href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/08/10/ios-27-beta-5/\">released beta 5</a> for iOS 27 and companion updates, but the company also shipped a surprise second wave of betas, for iOS 26.6.1, macOS 26.6.2 and more.</p>",
